Why the pools are here at all
-----------------------------

Both bodies publish these pools so that anyone can study and teach from them,
and ELMER reproduces the questions and keyed answers exactly as released,
because that is what appears on the test. Redistributing them is intended and
permitted; relicensing them is not, which is why the LICENSE is scoped and
this file exists.
